	<meta property="og:description" content="New funding accelerates a platform built for a world where AI agents and human engineers analyze, manage, and operationalize data together Boston, MA – June 3, 2026 – Coralogix, the data and AI platform for observability, today announced it has raised $200 million in Series F funding. The round was led by Advent and CPPIB, [&hellip;]" />
